      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Elizabeth could easily afford to move into the big city but she\u2019d
    rather drive for an hour every morning to work because she likes the small-town
    vibe of where she grew up. Due to her intense and serious attitude towards her
    work, none of her coworkers would expect her to be artistic in the slightest,
    but secretly she\u2019s been a passionate closet musician ever since watching
    Moldova in Eurovision back in 2010, and often plays her signature instrument(s)
    to relieve stress after a long day at work. "
